# What `vercel deploy` must never upload from a working copy (WP-06).
# Vercel builds from the uploaded files, not from git, so anything git ignores would still be sent.
# Secrets: every env file, including the staging values and Vercel's own link folder.
.env*
.vercel
# Local databases, captured data (players' details) and owner exports.
.local/
data-exports/
# Dependencies and build output: Vercel installs and builds its own.
node_modules/
.next/
.firebase/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.log
